<section class="service-band how-check" aria-labelledby="how-check-title">
    <div class="story-head">
        <h2 id="how-check-title" data-i18n="home.howTitle">How to View &amp; Download Your Online Electricity Bill</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps steps-grid how-check__steps">
        <li>
            <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
            <strong data-i18n="home.how1Title">Locate your reference number</strong>
            <span data-i18n="home.how1Body">Find the 14-digit reference number on your previous utility bill copy (top left).</span>
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
            <strong data-i18n="home.how2Title">Select your DISCO</strong>
            <span data-i18n="home.how2Body">Choose your electricity distribution company from the menu above.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
            <strong data-i18n="home.how3Title">Enter and check</strong>
            <span data-i18n="home.how3Body">Type your reference number or consumer ID into the input field and click Check Bill.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
            <strong data-i18n="home.how4Title">View or print</strong>
            <span data-i18n="home.how4Body">View, print, or save your official duplicate bill from the result page.</span>
        </li>
    </ol>
</section>

<div class="ad-slot" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="service-band tools-band" aria-labelledby="tools-title">
    <div class="story-head">
        <h2 id="tools-title" data-i18n="home.toolsTitle">Electricity Tools &amp; Calculators</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-grid">
        <a class="tool-card" href="/bill-calculator">
            <strong>Bill Estimator / Calculator</strong>
            <span>Estimate your monthly bill from consumed units, then open the live duplicate for the exact payable amount.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="tool-card" href="/peak-hours-guide">
            <strong>Peak Hours Timings Chart</strong>
            <span>Peak vs off-peak timing guidance for time-of-use meters across Pakistan DISCOs.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="tool-card" href="/unit-rates-tariff">
            <strong>Latest NEPRA Unit Rates (Tariff)</strong>
            <span>Overview of electricity slab pricing. Always verify payable amounts on your official bill.</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="service-band charges-band" aria-labelledby="charges-title">
    <div class="story-head">
        <h2 id="charges-title" data-i18n="home.chargesTitle">Understanding Your Electricity Bill Taxes &amp; Surcharges</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lead" data-i18n="home.chargesLead">Pakistani utility bills often include more than energy charges. These common line items explain why the payable amount differs from a simple units × rate calculation.</p>
    <div class="charge-grid">
        <article class="charge-card">
            <h3>Fuel Price Adjustment (FPA)</h3>
            <p>A monthly adjustment that reflects changes in generation fuel costs, applied per unit as notified for the billing period.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="charge-card">
            <h3>Neelum Jhelum Surcharge (NJ)</h3>
            <p>A surcharge linked to the Neelum–Jhelum hydropower project, shown as a separate amount on many DISCO bills.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="charge-card">
            <h3>Electricity Duty</h3>
            <p>A provincial duty calculated on electricity consumption; the exact rate depends on your province and tariff category.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="charge-card">
            <h3>TV Fee</h3>
            <p>A fixed monthly television fee collected with electricity bills where applicable, separate from energy charges.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="charge-card">
            <h3>GST / Sales Tax</h3>
            <p>Federal or provincial sales tax applied on taxable components of the bill according to current tax rules.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="charge-card">
            <h3>Quarter Tariff Adjustment (QTR)</h3>
            <p>Periodic tariff true-ups that reconcile earlier provisional rates with NEPRA-determined adjustments for the quarter.</p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="ad-slot" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="service-band home-faqs" id="faqs" aria-labelledby="home-faq-title">
    <div class="story-head">
        <h2 id="home-faq-title" data-i18n="home.faqTitle">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>
        <a href="/faqs" data-i18n="home.faqAll">All questions</a>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list" data-faq-accordion>
        @{
            var faqIndex = 0;
        }
        @foreach (var item in SiteContent.HomeFaqs)
        {
            faqIndex++;
            <details class="faq">
                <summary>
                    <h3 class="faq-q" data-i18n="@($"home.faq{faqIndex}q")">@item.Question</h3>
                </summary>
                <p data-i18n="@($"home.faq{faqIndex}a")">@item.Answer</p>
            </details>
        }
    </div>
</section>
